{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118227","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118227/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118227/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118227/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118227","id":4208382978,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7QEi5g","number":118227,"title":"Replace `Callable::is_valid` with `is_null` in Jolt module","user":{"login":"mihe","id":4884246,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODQyNDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4884246?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe","html_url":"https://github.com/mihe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","color":"aaccff","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":370471880,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzNzA0NzE4ODA=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:physics","name":"topic:physics","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","color":"447777","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","number":25,"title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":341,"closed_issues":2335,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T03:07:42Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":6,"created_at":"2026-04-05T19:18:58Z","updated_at":"2026-08-14T00:10:16Z","closed_at":"2026-08-13T23:58:48Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118227","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118227","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118227.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118227.patch","merged_at":"2026-08-13T23:58:48Z"},"body":"Improves #118047 (but needs #118236 to actually fix it).\r\nDepends on #118229.\r\n\r\n`Callable::is_valid` is mildly expensive, and we're calling it from a number of hot code paths in the Jolt module, some of which are in multi-threaded contexts, causing contention at the spin lock in `ObjectDB::get_instance`.\r\n\r\n**EDIT:** It's perhaps more fair to say that `Callable::is_valid` is expensive _because_ of the spin lock in `ObjectDB::get_instance`, and is seemingly (when ignoring the problem described below) redundant as used in this module anyway, since `Callable::callp` is already doing the validity check.\r\n\r\nThis change replaces all instances of `Callable::is_valid` with `Callabe::is_null` instead, which only checks to see if the `Callable` is a non-empty reference.\r\n\r\n<details><summary><i>[Resolved issue, click to expand/collapse]</i></summary>\r\n<p>\r\n\r\nThis has one rather serious implication currently, which is that if somebody has set any of these callbacks:\r\n\r\n1. `PhysicsServer3D::area_set_monitor_callback`\r\n2. `PhysicsServer3D::area_set_area_monitor_callback`\r\n3. `PhysicsServer3D::body_set_state_sync_callback`\r\n4. `PhysicsServer3D::body_set_force_integration_callback`\r\n\r\n... and then frees the target object for that callback, before removing the relevant area/body from the physics space first (or clearing the callback), they can theoretically be subject to a `nullptr` access in release builds, due to this `#ifdef` here:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/ee713ccb7cbaddf59f8258ed6663461779d00856/core/variant/callable.cpp#L60-L70\r\n\r\nThis particular `#ifdef` has come up before as being highly questionable, so I'll just make a separate pull request to remove it. That should allow `Callable::callp` to safely return `CALL_ERROR_INSTANCE_IS_NULL` in all cases where the object has been freed already (apart from race conditions).\r\n\r\nNote that this `nullptr` access is only applicable to custom physics bodies created through `PhysicsServer3D` and **not** applicable to the built-in physics scene nodes, as they not only perform the appropriate cleanup, but also use `callable_mp` when binding the callbacks, meaning a `CallableCustomMethodPointer`, which always checks against `ObjectDB` before calling, in all builds.\r\n\r\n</p>\r\n</details> ","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118227/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118227/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}